# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment and build artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# editable-install build artifact
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — never relax these
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
token/
.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Point clouds
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every cloud is large and regenerable: re-extract locally, or pull the mirror
# from Hugging Face (see the README's Stage 0). `data/` covers the whole tree,
# which is why there are no per-directory *.npy / *.parquet rules — they were
# redundant with this line and are gone.
data/
# `data` is a symlink to the shared cluster store on this machine; the
# trailing-slash rule above does not match a symlink, so name it bare too.
data

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run outputs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing under output/ goes to GitHub: data and results upload to
# Hugging Face. Scripts that produce published results must live in the
# repo tree, not under output/ (a lost script once made the E8 primary
# result unreproducible — 2026-08-03 review).
output/

# Generated exploratory figures (large plotly HTML; regenerable, kept on disk).
# Note this pattern is one level deep by design: it catches
# src/<experiment>/figures/ and nothing further up.
src/*/figures/

# Refactor verification scratch (large; sha.txt + dirnames stay tracked)
src/role_manifold/refactors/baselines/*/golden/
src/role_manifold/refactors/baselines/*/extra-reference/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working notes, not deliverables
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# docs/ is a scratch tree: dated planning notes plus 24 MB of downloaded
# reference PDFs. Neither is a deliverable and neither is reachable from
# code, so the whole tree stays local (the papers are all public arXiv IDs).
docs/
plans/
DESIGN.md
RESEARCH.md
.claude/

# The per_persona scratch write-ups (ANALYSIS, METRICS, FIGURES, CALIBRATION,
# ...). The two docs that ARE deliverables — METHODS.md and README.md — live
# beside the code at src/per_persona_geometry/ and are tracked. Whether any of
# md/ should join them is still open.
src/per_persona_geometry/md/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendored / relocated source repos
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
exploratory/assistant_axis_traits/
exploratory/persona_vectors/

# Local working notes, never committed
.labbook/
wiki/
lit-review.md
novelty-assessment.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cluster job setup
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HTCondor infra is site-specific (absolute paths, submit files, run logs) and
# is never patched into tracked files.
jobs_condor/


extra/

# Judge-prompt batches and run outputs written under prompts/ by the September
# steering judges. Files tracked before this rule (README, verify_steering.py,
# routes_by_k.json, persona_examples.json) stay tracked.
prompts/ablation/*/
prompts/generated/
